<title>OMAN: Oman banks lift 95 profits by 27 pct - Central Bank.</title>
<headline>Oman banks lift 95 profits by 27 pct - Central Bank.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's commercial banks lifted net profits to 32.2 million rials in 1995 from 25.4 million rials in 1994, the Oman news agency said on Monday, quoting the central bank annual report.</p>
<p>It said gross profits rose to 44.6 million rials in 1995 from 38.7 million rials in 1994. The banks' capital rose 6.7 percent to 174.9 million rials in 1995, the report said.</p>
<p>($1 = 0.38 rials)</p>
</text>
